if 'Lesson chapters' not in page:page=page.replace('</main>',extra+'</main>')
(V/'index.html').write_text(page,encoding='utf-8');sec=int(r['durationSeconds']);stamp=f'{sec//60}:{sec%60:02}'
catalog=R/'videos/index.html';body=catalog.read_text(encoding='utf-8');card=f'<article data-project="{N}"><span>CLAUDE MANAGED AGENTS · LAB 03 STEP BY STEP</span><a href="{N}/index.html"><img loading="lazy" src="{N}/cover.png" alt="{html.escape(TITLE)}"></a><div><h2>{html.escape(TITLE)}</h2><p>Verified · {stamp} · 1080p · Yash narration · offline presets and two live runs</p><a href="{N}/{r["file"]}">MP4</a> · <a href="{N}/index.html">Player and chapters</a></div></article>'
if f'data-project="{N}"' not in body:catalog.write_text(body.replace('<main>','<main>'+card,1),encoding='utf-8')
(V/'README.txt').write_text(f'CLAUDE MANAGED AGENTS: {TITLE.upper()}\nDuration: {stamp}. 1920x1080, 30 fps, H.264/AAC. Inworld Yash, TTS 2, enhanced, balanced delivery, speaking rate 1.25, 48kHz.\n\n48 scenes: cover; overview; Lab 03; Learn tab; 4 concept map regions; 4 lab walkthrough steps; enabled vs permitted mapping; presets; session toolset; bash allowlist; Read-only; Unavailable Write; Denied Write; Permitted edit (calls, traversal denials, file on disk); experiment table; live disabled; restart; live deadline and budget; live Denied Write (calls, denials, message); live Permitted edit (calls, outputs, message); live table; comparison; 5 TypeScript code sections; Agent SDK to Managed Agents mapping and live-port source (platform source viewer); knowledge check; summary.\n\nCaptured from the platform running in a fresh clone (C:\\Students). Exactly two billed live runs were made with a 120-second deadline: Denied Write (write denied by host) and Permitted edit (exact cp allowed by host, edit performed according to Claude). Live outputs were downloaded from the session (files.list with the managed-agents beta, downloadable files only) and verified on disk. MANAGED_LIVE_ENABLED was set back to false afterwards.\n\nRebuild (platform running from the clone): node scripts/capture-lab03-walkthrough.mjs offline; enable live, restart, node scripts/capture-lab03-walkthrough.mjs live; python scripts/create-lab03-walkthrough.py; node scripts/capture-lab03-walkthrough-slides.mjs; python scripts/create-lab03-walkthrough.py; python scripts/audit-lab03-walkthrough.py; python -u scripts/build-narrated-presentation.py --project {N}; python scripts/finish-lab03-walkthrough.py\n',encoding='utf-8')
